                    <h3 class="svc-panel-title">Process Mining &amp; Discovery</h3>
                    <p class="svc-panel-copy">Understand where time and money actually go, with end-to-end process mapping, analysis grounded in the business's own data, and a clear order of what to fix first.</p>
