                            <ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"/><path d="M3 5v14a9 3 0 0 0 18 0V5"/><path d="M3 12a9 3 0 0 0 18 0"/>
                        </svg>
                    </span>
                    <h3 class="svc-panel-title">Data &amp; Integration Layer</h3>
                    <p class="svc-panel-copy">Turn scattered data into a single source of truth, with system integration, records that carry their context, and the forecasting that commercial decisions depend on.</p>
                    <ul class="svc-caps">
                        <li>ERP and database integration</li>
